<p>
Tiny gold crosses<br>
hang from sparkling<br>
gold chains,<br>
signs of<br>
wealth, affluence,<br>
and good taste,<br>
compared to<br>
a large wooden cross<br>
covered in blood,<br>
an instrument of torture,<br>
a symbol designed<br>
to bring terror<br>
to enemies of the state.
</p>

<p>
On this day, Lord,<br>
give me a vision<br>
of the horror of the cross,<br>
for without it<br>
there is no beauty<br>
of the cross.
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>


